# ==============================================================================
# LLMZIP .gitignore Specification
# Defines precise exclusion rules to ensure ONLY clean, reproducible source code,
# declarative specs, C SDK headers, multi-language documentation, and verification
# scripts are tracked on GitHub.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Rust & Build Artifacts (DO NOT COMMIT) ---
target/
dist/
**/*.rs.bk
*.d
*.rlib
*.pdb
*.exp
*.lib
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.exe

# --- Sandboxes, Scratch Dirs & Generated Model Binaries (DO NOT COMMIT) ---
# .scratch/ contains temporary evaluation runs, local issue working notes,
# and heavy generated model files (.gguf, .safetensors, .wal, .bin).
.scratch/

# --- Private Marketing & Launch Plans (STRICT CONFIDENTIAL - NEVER COMMIT) ---
marketing/
.marketing/
.private/
marketing_private/
*.marketing.*
*.private.*

# --- Internal Docs, Reports & Agent Rules (EXCLUDED FROM REPO) ---
docs/
CONTEXT.md
AGENTS.md
test_sandbox_qa.ps1

# --- Spec-Driven Development & Agent Skills (EXCLUDED FROM REPO) ---
.github/skills/
.specify/
specs/[0-9]*/

# --- Model & Checkpoint Binaries (DO NOT COMMIT) ---
# Prevent accidental leak of multi-gigabyte weight files into Git LFS / history.
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.wal
*.lock
*.part
*.unverified
*.poisoned

# --- Operating System & Editor Junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# --- Automated Profiling & Crash Logs ---
*.log
*.profdata
*.profraw
cobertura.xml
